  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The Immortal Gu recipe of bathing flames Immortal Gu is part of the fire path true inheritance left by Stunning Immortal. A mortal Gu Master excavated it by chance, and once news spread, Southern Border super forces moved on the find. Wu Yong sent Wu Yi Ran, who found no Stunning Immortal true inheritance left, only that recipe. The inheritance had been said to be destroyed, and the resurfaced recipe revived hope that more of it remained.",
      "chapters": [
        1338
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_recipe",
        "gu_bathing_flames_immortal_gu",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_wu_yong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Lou Lan cultivates strength path primarily along with fire path and holds few strength path Immortal Gu against many fire path Immortal Gu, paired with countless fire path immortal killer moves left by her aunt in her aunt’s fire path true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        1338
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "path_strength",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Purple Mountain True Monarch gives a female Gu Master the first half of a fire path true inheritance and tells her that after reaching rank five she can seek the second half somewhere in Northern Plains, with a chance to become an immortal if she obtains it.",
      "chapters": [
        1372
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "halved-gift",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan takes Fire Plain grotto-heaven and finds Fire Plain true inheritance among its cultivation inheritances; it is a high quality fire path true inheritance with the profound method furious red heart flames, which Fire Plain Grotto Lord had used before his death to threaten Fang Yuan and which was used in his suicide, and it also holds the fire path killer move humanly flame smoke with human path effects.",
      "chapters": [
        2108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-plain-copy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_fire_plain_grotto_heaven",
        "inh_fire_plain_true_inheritance",
        "char_fire_plain_grotto_lord"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After a deal over Human Smoke Mountain, three immortals take Chai clan’s human path results and leave a fire path true inheritance plus three rank eight Immortal Gu with Chai clan.",
      "chapters": [
        2139
